WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:03.360
Hi mystery recapped here . Today&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:08.720
I'm going to explain the second part&nbsp;
of the action sci-fi movie Parasytes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:18.320
Spoilers ahead. Watch out and take care.
The movie begins with the police using a serial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:23.520
killer named Uragami to identify mysterious&nbsp;
aliens that have invaded the humans.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.640
These aliens are called the parasites and&nbsp;
infect the humans by entering their brains.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:34.320
These parasites take over the human consciousness&nbsp;
and turn them into violent cannibals. The police&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:39.440
are hopeful about identifying the aliens through&nbsp;
Uragami, who has witnessed the parasites feeding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:45.440
on humans before. They bring Shinichi before the&nbsp;
serial killer but he fails to identify him.
 
&nbsp;

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:51.120
After being let go, Shinichi continues to hunt&nbsp;
down the parasites who terrorize the humans for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:56.080
food with the help of Migi, the parasite that&nbsp;
affects his right hand. Although Shinichi is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:01.200
still a human, he is progressively growing&nbsp;
stronger because of Migi. Using his powers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.720
he effortlessly takes down a parasite feeding on a&nbsp;
human in an abandoned building. After killing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:11.920
alien, Shinichi feels someone’s presence&nbsp;
outside and rushes to inspect. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:17.520
he fails to notice an investigative journalist&nbsp;
named Shiro Kuramori hiding behind a pile of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:18.160
junk. Kuramori has been secretly spying&nbsp;
on Shinichi and Migi for a while now. 
&nbsp;

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:23.840
The city’s mayor Takeshi Hirokawa, who has also&nbsp;
been taken over by the parasites, grows worried&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:29.200
about Shinichi killing the aliens. He complains&nbsp;
about Shinichi to Ryoko Tamiya, the leader of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:35.760
parasites but she forbids him from going after the&nbsp;
boy. Tamiya, who now is a mother to a human baby,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:41.920
intends to use Shinichi and Migi for her research&nbsp;
on the parasite’s coexistence with the humans.
&nbsp;

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:48.400
Afterwards, Hirokawa meets with another parasite&nbsp;
named Goto. Goto is an extremely powerful parasite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:55.120
as his body is made up of 5 parasites.&nbsp;
Goto advises Hirokawa to kill Shinichi.
&nbsp;

00:01:55.120 --> 00:02:00.480
It is then revealed that Kuramori was hired&nbsp;
by Tamiya to spy on Shinichi. He hands her the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:05.520
evidence he has collected so far and suggests&nbsp;
they should give it to the police. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:11.360
Tamiya advises him against it, saying they need&nbsp;
more information on the boy. Kuramori, who is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:17.360
a single father of a girl named Yumi, has grown&nbsp;
close to Tamiya over time. He relates to Tamiya,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:22.720
who is also a single parent and agrees to continue&nbsp;
to gather more information on Shinichi.
 
&nbsp;

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:27.360
Shinichi eventually catches Kuramori&nbsp;
following him red handed with a camera&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:33.360
and confronts him. Migi asks Shinichi to kill&nbsp;
the reporter but he refuses to kill a human.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:37.840
After learning that Tamiya had hired him to spy&nbsp;
on them, Migi tells the reporter that she is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:44.160
parasite herself and much more dangerous than&nbsp;
other parasites. Shinichi and Migi tell Kuramori&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:49.360
that he is playing with fire and advise him to&nbsp;
stay away from Tamiya and keep a low profile. 
&nbsp;

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:54.080
Kuramori is in utter disbelief but&nbsp;
decides to continue his investigation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:57.520
He goes on to interview the mayor&nbsp;
Hirokawa about the parasites.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:03.440
Afraid of being exposed, Hirokawa orders his&nbsp;
men to kill the reporter after the interview.
&nbsp;

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:09.600
Meanwhile, Migi senses the presence of 5 parasites&nbsp;
nearby while returning home from school. Migi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:14.640
advises Shinichi to run away. However, they are&nbsp;
eventually caught and to their astonishment,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:18.880
they learn that they are faced with a&nbsp;
man that has 5 monsters in his body.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:24.800
A cat and mouse chase follows. After reading the&nbsp;
man’s brain waves, Migi advises Shinichi to kill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:31.120
the original monster using his speed. Shinichi&nbsp;
then swings by a tree and beheads the monster.
&nbsp;

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:36.480
They then run away and the man again comes back&nbsp;
to life. The parasite in the man’s right hand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:41.840
who is revealed to be Goto, takes the place of the&nbsp;
head and orders the parasite in the severed head,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:45.920
Miki, to occupy the right hand. 
When Kuramori returns home,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:50.720
he finds police in front of his building.&nbsp;
Panicking, he runs to his apartment to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:56.000
learn that his daughters had been killed by the&nbsp;
parasites who had come looking for him. Kuramori&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:01.200
is traumatized by his daughter’s death and&nbsp;
refuses to cooperate with Detective Hirama.
 
&nbsp;

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:07.040
Meanwhile, Tamiya is furious to learn that the&nbsp;
parasites tried to kill Shinichi and Kuramori.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:12.400
She expresses regret over the senseless killing&nbsp;
of Kuramori’s daughter. She fears that senselessly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:17.680
killing humans could give rise to an uprising&nbsp;
strong enough to exterminate all parasites.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:23.280
She then threatens to kill Hirokawa and other&nbsp;
parasites herself if they again try to undermine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:28.560
her authority. Ever since Tamiya has given birth&nbsp;
to her human son, she is increasingly exhibiting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:34.000
more and more human instincts such as kindness&nbsp;
and going above and beyond to care for one’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:39.200
own child. She breast feeds the baby and tries&nbsp;
to make him laugh by making funny expressions.
&nbsp;

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.400
Detective Hirama learns that Kuramori has&nbsp;
fled from the hotel where he was kept under&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:48.720
police protection and immediately heads out to&nbsp;
look for the bereaved father with his unit.
&nbsp;

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:53.600
Swearing revenge, Kuramori kidnaps&nbsp;
Tamiya’s son and leaves her a note,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:59.840
calling her to a park so she can see him kill her&nbsp;
baby. Tamiya immediately rushes to Shinichi’s home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:06.160
to seek his help. However, Shinichi isn’t home&nbsp;
and she runs into his girlfriend Satomi. Satomi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:10.080
gives Tamiya Shinichi’s number. Tamiya&nbsp;
explains to him on the phone that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:15.280
isn’t responsible for the parasites coming after&nbsp;
them and asks for his help to save her baby.
&nbsp;

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:20.400
As Tamiya and Shinichi arrive at the park to meet&nbsp;
Kuramori, the Japanese Special Assault Team(SAT)&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:27.120
led by Yamagishi starts preparing to raid the town&nbsp;
hall to kill all the parasites after learning the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:32.080
truth about Hirokawa, the city’s mayor. People&nbsp;
inside the building are ordered to vacate the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:37.200
premises. They are made to undergo an x-ray scan&nbsp;
and the monsters identified by the x-ray machine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:42.960
are executed on the spot. After evacuating&nbsp;
the civilians, the SAT team then storms into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:48.720
the building and corner Hirokawa. After finding&nbsp;
himself cornered, Hirokawa goes on a rant against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:57.200
humans calling them the real parasite. But,&nbsp;
Yamagishi cuts his monologue short and sprays&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:02.880
bullets into his body. To his astonishment,&nbsp;
Yamagishi realises that Hirokawa is actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:08.240
a human. Hirokawa was helping the monsters&nbsp;
because of his principles and beliefs. Just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:13.760
as the armed men begin to wrap their heads around&nbsp;
the revelation, the last remaining parasite, Goto,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:19.680
shows up. The SAT team bombards the monster with&nbsp;
bullets but he blocks them without much effort.
&nbsp;

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:24.240
At the park, Tamiya explains to Kuramori that&nbsp;
she didn’t order the killing of his daughter but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:30.080
Kuramori, blinded by revenge, refuses to believe&nbsp;
her. Shinichi also tries to persuade him against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:35.360
harming the innocent baby. However, Kuromori&nbsp;
is hell bent on avenging his daughter’s death.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:39.280
As he proceeds to throw Tamiya’s son&nbsp;
from the bridge, the police arrives.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:44.800
Left with no other choice, Tamiya kills Kuramori&nbsp;
and saves her son, exposing herself in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:50.720
process. Kuramori falls to his death and the&nbsp;
police point their guns at Tamiya. Shinichi is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:55.840
stunned that Tamiya exposed her identity to save&nbsp;
a human baby’s life. Instead of running away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.840 --> 00:07:01.280
Tamiya starts walking towards Shinichi with the&nbsp;
baby. Detective Hirama warns her against taking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:06.800
another step but she continues to walk towards&nbsp;
Shinichi and the police sprays her with bullets.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:11.520
Clinging on to her last few breaths, she hands&nbsp;
the baby to Shinichi and tells him that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:16.640
doesn’t wish to run away because she doesn’t want&nbsp;
her son to live the life of a fugitive. She asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:22.240
Shinichi to look after her son before collapsing&nbsp;
and passing away. Shinichi breaks into tears&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:31.840
as Tamiya reminds him of his late mother. Satomi&nbsp;
arrives on the scene and comforts her boyfriend. 
&nbsp;

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:36.240
As Detective Hirama proceeds to take Shinichi&nbsp;
for an interrogation, he is informed that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:41.120
the SAT team is dead. He immediately&nbsp;
rushes to the town hall with Shinichi. 
&nbsp;

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:47.200
At the town hall, Goto throws Yamagishi’s&nbsp;
severed before Hirama. Angered, Hirama shoots&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:52.720
the parasite but it deflects the bullets back to&nbsp;
him, killing him on the spot. The police retreat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:58.800
while sensing danger to his life, Shinichi runs&nbsp;
away in a car. Goto follows him on a motor bike&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:04.400
and eventually catches up to him. Before Shinichi&nbsp;
and Migi could even realise, Goto jumps on top of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:10.240
his car and attacks him. Migi drives the car as&nbsp;
Shinichi tries to dodge the parasite’s attack.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:16.160
A long struggle follows and Migi eventually loses&nbsp;
control of the car and it drives off a bridge.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:22.560
However, Migi manages to save Shinichi and itself.&nbsp;
Goto sustains injury but also survives the crash&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:27.920
and starts chasing the two into the forest. Migi&nbsp;
comes up with a plan and they decide to ambush&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:33.280
the parasite. Migi attacks the parasite from a&nbsp;
tree and Shinichi sneaks up on him from behind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:39.520
but the parasite tanks their plan. Left with no&nbsp;
choice, Migi asks Shinichi to run away as it keeps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:45.840
the parasite busy. Shinichi refuses to sacrifice&nbsp;
his friend but Migi forces him to go. Goto&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:52.000
eventually kills Migi and Shinichi runs away.
Shinichi seeks refuge in an abandoned building&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.000 --> 00:09:00.720
and calls Satomi. He is devastated by&nbsp;
Migi’s death and Satomi comforts him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:06.640
She reminds him that he still has her and this&nbsp;
is not the end. The two then start making out. 
&nbsp;

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:11.280
The next morning, Shinichi discovers that a&nbsp;
part of Migi is still in his right hand due&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:15.760
to his body being infected with Migi’s&nbsp;
cell. In the previous part of the film,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:21.600
Migi had used its cells to repair Shinichi’s heart&nbsp;
damaged by a parasite. Shinichi also realises that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:27.920
if Migi is still a part of his body, Goto can use&nbsp;
that to track him. He freaks and proceeds to flee&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:32.960
with his girlfriend. However, the parasite&nbsp;
catches up to them. To save Satomi’s life,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:38.240
Shinichi reveals his location and lures&nbsp;
Goto into a garbage disposal facility. 
&nbsp;

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:43.920
A battle follows. Goto badly batters the&nbsp;
boy but even without Migi he holds his own.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:48.720
He grabs a metal rod and stabs Goto with&nbsp;
it but it barely does any harm to him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:54.560
Goto then proceeds to kill Shinichi but suddenly&nbsp;
Migi comes to life. It is revealed that Migi had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.560 --> 00:10:00.400
not died. It had transferred to Goto’s hand. Migi&nbsp;
returns to Shinichi’s right hand and Goto starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:06.160
disintegrating because of the toxins released&nbsp;
by Migi in his body. At last, the last monster,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:12.320
Goto’s torso with a beating heart, remains.&nbsp;
Migi reveals that there’s a 50/50 chance of Goto&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:17.280
surviving. Refusing to let that happen, Shinichi&nbsp;
proceeds to kill the monsters but suddenly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:22.240
remembers Tamiya’s words that these parasites&nbsp;
are just trying to survive on earth just like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:27.040
humans. But Shinichi ultimately decides that&nbsp;
even if the parasites are just trying to survive,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:32.160
he must protect the ones he loves. He tells the&nbsp;
monster that humans may not be perfect but they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:37.920
deserve to live before throwing it in the fire. 
Few days later, as Shinichi does his homework,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:42.080
Migi tells him that since all monsters have been&nbsp;
killed, there’s no need for it to be around.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:48.320
Migi says that if it stays around, it could only&nbsp;
cause problems for Shinichi with the authorities.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:54.000
Migi intends to go into hibernation for&nbsp;
several years, decades or perhaps to death&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:58.560
and in return Shinichi will get his right&nbsp;
hand back. Shinichi is heartbroken to hear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:03.760
his plans to leave but Migi tells him that it&nbsp;
is time for them to walk alone. Migi thanks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:09.120
Shinichi for everything before turning into a&nbsp;
normal hand as Shinichi breaks into tears. 
&nbsp;

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:15.600
Some years pass by. Shinichi and Satomi meet to&nbsp;
visit Tamiya’s son, Taiki Tamiya. The baby seems&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:20.320
to be fond of the two and runs to them.
Afterwards, Shinichi goes to buy coffee&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:25.520
for Satomi. Uragami, the serial killer from&nbsp;
earlier in the movie, watches him leave and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:31.520
uses the opportunity to kidnap Satomi, taking her&nbsp;
to the top of a building. Shinichi notices him and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:37.120
follows him to the roof. The deranged killer holds&nbsp;
Satomi at knife point and states his belief that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:42.560
all humans are monsters because they have been&nbsp;
killing each other since time immemorial. Uragami,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:47.840
who thinks that Shinichi is a parasite, then asks&nbsp;
him for his opinion. Shinichi proceeds to reveal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:53.600
his identity to the killer but Satomi discourages&nbsp;
him from doing so. Angered, the killer pushes her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:58.720
down the building. Shinichi runs to save the girl.&nbsp;
He punches the killer and extends his hand from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:04.880
the edge of the top. However, Satomi goes beyond&nbsp;
his reach. All the time he has spent with Satomi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:10.160
flashes before Shinichi’s eyes. Suddenly, he&nbsp;
realises that he is holding Satomi’s hand and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:15.600
pulls her to safety. As they breathe a sigh of&nbsp;
relief, Shinichi figures out that Migi momentarily&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:20.560
woke up to help him save Satomi. 
